{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5e1fe7f187dd829aae0d62ee439de7cc2bb5344b36ae53be7d4deac7e540272",
      "text": "连结的心意，传递的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c668dc1d456dd30cfc21873b13cdf58648ca599af9fdc5a76008288e9c99fd1f",
      "text": "为了让年轻群体对日本传统工艺产生兴趣，\n彩接到了举办小型演出的邀约。\n为了让展览会更加热闹，三人思索着是否有自己力所能及之事，\n并主动提出了方案。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5e1fe7f187dd829aae0d62ee439de7cc2bb5344b36ae53be7d4deac7e540272",
      "text": "连结的心意，传递的心意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69d15ba9b45b9926d6a31f4ac1be0b842457b21d728e81250144e74fad886a1a",
      "text": "传统工艺展览会·会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02f2a89ec6891f07f27d402d42e470ef992a92a0f255370c67e49ed2135a18ab",
      "text": "这只抹茶碗的色泽真是绝美呢。器型也很易于点茶，\n感觉能够推荐给许多不同的人使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c3b4e015a8250c27f87fee760220c34a92c5d84663e122459fe5981e3bdc453",
      "text": "哎呀，这匹布料真不错呢。\n图样设计相当抓人眼球。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc673422f714a73d786735df9364a03379aceaf586db0ac9c15a01267f07a8a",
      "text": "咱还琢磨有什么熟悉的老物件呢，果然还是高座折扇\n喵。这可真是好东西喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e80c9e2dbe0da475019e5f69295f42df0eae1e3f1f584831a0a6f3027fb37a8c",
      "text": "各位果然最先留意的，\n还是自己熟悉的传统工艺品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:123073765403e28ad35225468c57566cf2d46835cba95d17a137e5eeded8e7ce",
      "text": "抱歉，一时有些忘情了……不过，其他传统工艺品\n也同样非常出色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35b07db5ed7906895a875d743151ffce1416ff68fee30a73c5d033d85b86f9b8",
      "text": "为了能让更多的年轻人们都来欣赏这些展品，\n我们一定会好好做好宣传的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8038cca0186135a33ed7a19bde06a7dd64b24b6aa08ccbea198d6a7d4534164",
      "text": "就拜托各位了。正因为是长期沉浸于传统艺术的各位，\n才一定有只有你们才能传达的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17d244bde97484e33fe8ae5168181ed9f398e789ac13ef0092f3cf72a1657e3",
      "text": "对方就是看中这一点才发来委托的不是吗？\n我们会拿出超出他们预期的成果给他们看的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2483c6c1664b0ff0f1beb3a0b03f39a4b52138339f06ebf9a3472a202fb341e",
      "text": "借助在下们的力量，不仅是演出，\n连同这展览会也要轰轰烈烈地办得热热闹闹喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a155c11870848d3111e1da8d371901a82dcc91e1ec480f194dea63b8ef8bce0",
      "text": "嗯，我很期待！那么在商讨会开始之前\n还有一些时间，我们再多看看展品吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d456518ef894c5ba28f682538310cfe50a132e3f9094fcb7c2bd0abada628b",
      "text": "这一组盘子，上面绘制了生肖图样呢。\n……哎呀，猫柳先生。您快来看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2f99fbad19dbdddb70f89056cc79648de8250166147c1d9f3ab28e74e70ce66",
      "text": "噢噢～！连猫咪都有喵！\n这可不是十二生肖，而是十三生肖喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a8555ac48c136527e33442868392f10c05d1b06b303259ad53ce9335c463074",
      "text": "哎呀，那只猫，长得跟小少爷有点像呢。\n你们两个，不觉得吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a34bb850fff9fff535d16f43e08a3aa8b8ab69277c12d27aecd6cb4277d87d57",
      "text": "确实，听您这么一说好像还真有点……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91fd07546501d8d4aba36a537fea04aa7e225a92514d7da267c520e0b433e259",
      "text": "嗯，特别是这一块的感觉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95ac967d4972593a50d5b98834e26a4dc13380f7d329147637dfd28c557a3eb5",
      "text": "怎么连制作人君都这么说！\n有那么像喵吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c91afbffbd4f3af0032251765d6de13f109590650b56a808122ae59c026e4f9e",
      "text": "嗯，简直一模一样哦。呵呵呵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b8164f12dfdf4a0ab1e5504c89381e2a76e8423fd4fe4a26172faf6efa785c0",
      "text": "（这段对话是不是也能写进单口相声的段子里？\n不对不对，比起这个果然还是早上的那段更有意思……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c076c4fb9f324687372bb71d8f6d7c8d9681f00856db4c804de75ad4cd0527f9",
      "text": "（唔唔。只要跟大家在一起，\n素材段子就一直在源源不断地冒出来喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e774251dba0fa705f08ad181f9ece1982eafd035f287082dc5432c60c1a1c37",
      "text": "（咱至今为止观察过\n形形色色的人喵……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88554b4817e15f3d196d90d575e24b29625f7447e10e64a723436e8f1ffbd4e0",
      "text": "（但段子素材如此丰富的观察对象，\n以前还从来没遇到过喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:665a2243360159fac213ea20e2af548dfe58dad782df2eb8c6301cedb1c09a0c",
      "text": "（为了不遗漏任何好段子，\n咱可得更加仔细地观察大家才行喵！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1a80ffcae25c879e85336922bac1d02a62cbefada6656128a8ed9ba5983ea6",
      "text": "洽谈中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d772cb473b7f7d46658c1b2f8f5f641968b994f758c77e114b5acf67d1f350b",
      "text": "只要是支持彩的粉丝，\n对日本传统工艺的接受门槛应该也相对较低才对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ccee34f516ef17e7c479e63d1f682eaacf00c785b6cfcae21fab015ee8b5c00",
      "text": "基于这样的考量，这次才向各位提出了举办小型演出的邀约。\n还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a91635acb602759590e935bbe47baa8103a7249d87680bfecf37b6aba7152cd0",
      "text": "请包在我们身上！彩的成员们在成为偶像前，\n就已投身于传统艺术，有着极深的造诣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d64e04f660441be17db544893cc78a66092c54169b89d7afc1228f927187f04d",
      "text": "如您所言，\n我也认为与传统工艺品有着极高的契合度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6ccea84de53d7021b84e0da7da5a7076094dbb629c24baf708a34c4fefa0368",
      "text": "（这些老师的想法，或许与在下十分接近。\n既然如此……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1025f88155b8af4c9648f4f39106b076a24ecd1c6cc3b2dde59485ea527d0535",
      "text": "制作人，在下有一个提议想商量一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5a9101bf80229d386d73b82ededbc41b746915d6afceefc66b1804166b83cd",
      "text": "好的。请问是什么呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5beb9410eca12a0397968fea8d1f76d60d48e39f2b76eba5f40a81bd23321914",
      "text": "在演出之外，在下也想提供一些其他协助。\n不知猫柳先生和华村先生意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb412cdf0717178722f1c0e0ed8962de3868a9fc0b7fa9a0c44f007585747111",
      "text": "听起来很不错嘛！这主意，我赞成。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dd23933aeb243b535fa6d4c0fd45fca1b6a468590105fa5a0aa5ca68f985d6f",
      "text": "咱也举双手赞成喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ed82264cadf7af38ce2d2061e99e960f340c49465641e5fe1e1bc5414cd2e1b",
      "text": "制作人，您意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a249257ea11c127b62bf7d3b4f4b14fdeb42bd16ad081890e5a43f5c8074e521",
      "text": "我这边自然没有任何理由阻拦。\n……不知负责人先生觉得如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3faa83ada1e8e0cc7aea764398ca3d275acfd07103b68953e09b6e82e3d1b8bf",
      "text": "太感谢了！\n请务必拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ce7dcbc78f126328a60e8140f6aa1df449f9730681984c5d7af8f5ba9df30f9",
      "text": "那就这么定下来了。具体能做些什么，\n大家一起来集思广益吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000040:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d7f92e387840355ca9d57afcc932ef31b822f78e5af16176d2e5539c676b26e",
      "text": "出了好多点子呢。制作宣传海报、\n在脱口秀环节介绍工艺品……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bedb3d23715ddec46db0383e28f2e35421838138093d7f81410fc25dafaee28",
      "text": "我刚想到一个主意，工艺品的语音解说，\n交给我们来配音如何呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2460ea3783cc7f30a2ef65b7855532d5258cd27aa1a4e981102a5fb39a29435f",
      "text": "语音解说，是吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c108717f7e7405829b087952b231466da6570df18be51358fe8d6c425992f55",
      "text": "对呀，就是语音导览嘛。\n在美术馆和博物馆里经常见到的那种，懂吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:052ca5735a4766c83388415566779a03e931275a2a584e6941381efa646ec9ad",
      "text": "原来喵此！由在下们来进行解说，\n既能让大家了解工艺品的精妙，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c507741e22f7c8c20ec9fdc812328a6cb00c9ce7de66bb348aa971d7c4405e6e",
      "text": "又能激发起大家的兴趣喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69ac34b582dd1d2a33df46b5e3240d41d044e8f47c7e4bd34e5ba0c548422907",
      "text": "好主意啊……！如果能结合各位的专业知识，\n一定会是一份极其精彩的解说！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43413dbc24ee3415bf153650611fa6673997f1dcd2ce621670fd372c5607a3ab",
      "text": "那个……虽然很不好意思，但我不得不说……\n……要想实现这个可能有些困难。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51121bfdb0dc1304ef79c23c3ea66a5b027838eec95fb23ae18e5bdc1d06d480",
      "text": "坦白说，我们的预算并不是很充裕……\n如果做法过于繁复，恐怕会有些吃力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0511ebe16973e6bbf935a1b39b6bb3bd026697d8611a735d73a3a2f56ae1a3f9",
      "text": "原来如此，竟有这层缘由……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9942e505510a806c2e138103502d054ea8cc4d2c8749ea48b6462e15124c1cb3",
      "text": "既然有这样的难处那也没办法。\n我们就挑力所能及的范围来做吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a95e143ea34a2a8e8fbac0d012925c46800c4d109359e49950e68e595da2046c",
      "text": "确实喵！此外能够做到的事情\n还有好多好多喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f04d583365ca361ee9ad619ecac7cf44c90f0b0c8d29236713d2a7cf07af5f15",
      "text": "不，我们来做吧！\n请不必顾虑预算的问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e91a671145d5420f093d6c667ec2af08ffce89f6ab1a2d3e25882a93e3a0b9d",
      "text": "这话是什么意思呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb8d9be43e946435deadefea1c4b38fc1a8cd1b3f0b32be7ffa578272240452",
      "text": "可是制作人，该如何解决呢？\n需要花费额外资金是事实啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120d531ad649bc0f73478fd7e7f94ef6a94ef56f746bd78785b6eceded7a6ed0",
      "text": "难道说，你已经有什么好主意了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c298af745672dc50a5022965a4ff49f1bd6a4c9d98855ba6c6dfdba10b31b865",
      "text": "是的。我们可以采取由315 Production进行赞助的形式，\n仅参与接下来的这一届展览会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9ef78a3ade45ff9de2e6224147c407178dd8a082621f6f6be0935d1b1b52e8c",
      "text": "这样一来，应该就能控制在预算范围之内了。\n社长那边，由我去进行说明！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb19568a9c6976b8ffec9ef60b002fcb765f6c436d0dcdfab6249dbe32da1a84",
      "text": "（噢噢～！真不愧是制作人君喵！\n两人的表情也一下子都放晴了喵♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0983ba652122a034c445c1e3e4c6681e46ab8e06dc5eb162b88fd58b894e1f1d",
      "text": "如果真的能做到的话，那可就太感激不尽了……\n但真的，没有问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad1feee7bd9461e4aa412d020790e6b4806bcebf336a3bfdf35f03eaa638c67",
      "text": "请放宽心！制作人君他，\n可从来不会信口开河喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007f16c0917a943a9b7fe10ac6a88f6ec83da9b4bd7e6b5919bf27635fc2ad24",
      "text": "非常感谢您，制作人。\n按照这个方案，或许真能实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb261e2bfe16b2868d9f3b4705306f80579357795db3e52e5fda9113e390fc0",
      "text": "真的太感谢了！之后肯定还需要开会讨论细则。\n联系相关各方的事情就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bf3a12c0571f1444f04d41df35638f4929682bb549bb223a39c53989b9ae073",
      "text": "好的！那就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000120:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000123:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "text": "辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000123:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eea3bcd6d0f207bc1a0dfccb0f012664923b623e862802368900b0305af73b6",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n关于赞助的事情，已经顺利\n取得社长的许可了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51bf828e74cd1bf803552b967810a15b410091dafb0cea97b2c22900579aa083",
      "text": "谢谢你，\n制作人酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ded5eb5ad8e4960723e654aca569335bc52e9896799179aa2655715e6f329a18",
      "text": "这样一来语音导览的事情，\n应该就能顺利推进下去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d497da4e03a58139ec847ef20acce5ad059219e4fec498477b6df3d7bb231c8e",
      "text": "那么，我们在下次会议上，\n立刻敲定导览的详细内容吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88f5515df15f4c6bad720faa34d63156d576e806cd918a80d72b4a4d6195a6b4",
      "text": "正因为是我们，才有能够\n传达给大家的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf228fb2c598b6478640761522b3d222d8b48b63b532d1775cdd98aad06a5c5c",
      "text": "是的喵！\n在下也会源源不断地\n提出意见喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b300a44348285197c0f3467704e7c3c59eb3cfbe396455ac666e6d07d1dcfd11",
      "text": "咱从现在开始就已经期待起\n下一次会议了喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8592980c4110a5442514970d0a4f81598dc790be0655ed529196f0cc0332016a",
      "text": "正因为是长久接触日本传统的\n我们，才有能够传达出去的\n话语呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c10568cd63990997bba9a5c8f81b103443afaac7577c3c352231b559a3cea29",
      "text": "说的正是。录制语音导览时，\n我们也要时刻谨记这一点，\n构思文案吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cf8c66095cc59f8fb1e8ccb7cdaf9cb952159b0b067a47feeea0b3397c66c4",
      "text": "这一次的宣传，一定要由我们4个人\n一起办得圆满成功喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aee2a9f3999ceb4689fde4dfc22f1a0b95d17f7057dc5385b00f6646ca582fa7",
      "text": "（商讨的结果，定为由桐生先生负责折扇，九郎先生\n负责茶具，翔真先生负责和服的讲解！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cec474810dd0481ad4dc35fa2c1f8cf6e5da615e10fc02aa70448b97667a5dd",
      "text": "……然后呢，茶具的分类主要有两种最出名的。\n不过既然你本身也是茶道老师，就不需要我多加解释了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20341f0be8d7d36d963f0f4d3061ac39c30c419fffdbeefb51033087e07c4d8b",
      "text": "哪里的话。窑口师傅的讲解字字珠玑，令在下受益匪浅。\n不知可否劳烦您继续赐教？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c189d36c552c954504800d754d54ac713c924f0734c1996364748815865b74e9",
      "text": "（九郎君的眼睛都在闪闪发光喵。\n一提到茶道的事果然就完全不一样了喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b52846a6114ca39b93610d8f278482717237fa87f5cc80b6bf0bd24d375bfb",
      "text": "（再瞧瞧看，蝴蝶先生那边……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9339d966210d2c453d3bc34f56b6fbfc0cefa888aa654e260dc05042b182b042",
      "text": "毕竟我们想写一份带有彩这支队伍风格的台本\n呢。还可以多向您请教一些其他细节吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b7966cb038f5677d25756aa233e3033cf1caff9817b428e9fbd428a00f37acb",
      "text": "哎，当然可以！有什么想问的尽管问！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d5ad8a224bfcbcf8910027e68b51ec91d1edec03fb9d0b43dec2a1d62e1bad",
      "text": "（哦！看起来完全打成一片了喵）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5326e64f8db77a343e51c1bd287c36c93571da89a5872045bc341711b3ee809c",
      "text": "（哎呀呀，咱可不能闲着喵！\n在下也得多听听关于折扇的事才行）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1d3d6962abc054e51f4a06a9b4edfd755bd7a0f5bb9f45fe6440ba39b900fe1",
      "text": "哎呀，你们真了不起。\n能和你们一起工作太开心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86552ed18908c51c7950fdc1fea9d91693423ff0f682647645d83d5a8bd75962",
      "text": "我们才要感谢您呢，能听到这么多宝贵的信息，\n真是太棒了。感觉能做出一份优秀的语音导览了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d4ea21f2419e384e6d20070f6d4bb5c1146410784a881caf94095ed08e73d3e",
      "text": "最初听说要办偶像演出、往展览会引流的时候\n我还吓了一跳。不过在跟你们聊过之后我就明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14b915cb0805ee80470a7a1b959c3fc051a6e590ccd04441b699b1cde9b05d92",
      "text": "凭你们这份好学钻研的热情，一定能将传统工艺的魅力\n完完全全传达给许许多多的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68431ccb6534bbbb7035cd8c174ed7ebc10f946c800ed8982f8a910caec66fc5",
      "text": "承蒙厚爱。\n能得到您这样的赞誉，倍感鼓舞。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649961ac3f4f6c9d5ab7cfa927bb9d288e35ef453562f2b8ae8c656ccf6bcd32",
      "text": "对于长期接触传统艺术的各位，\n我私底下总擅自觉得十分亲近呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ef7aacc6eca58fd9a3655481d03e92c596ac942c84ef46f8990f0625ec08704",
      "text": "能和各位说上话，\n真是太好了。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f66f164c43547a1efd68a11e00a9bbf9f91da472b9e39e937c3b1fb081fe362",
      "text": "喵喵！原来是这样喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7edcfb46d1b3d83eb168f1c3b0633871f17315f85222279da03d02ad4b0e55de",
      "text": "哎呀，这可真是太巧了。\n我们刚才还在商量着要邀请各位来看演出呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bcf73826c2ba09330aa34e140aae28eabb23f607875042295c505349b83a8bc",
      "text": "九郎君，交给你了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f68b0a6e0b0980caf3fb7812f24b74dbe9066303c2a6d3f0abc460389acb88d4",
      "text": "这是彩的演出门票。若您不弃，\n还请务必来看看我们身为偶像的英姿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e588669974002e42c48a849b1ec3480c0b7735f83526455bbce5e7791d8ce41",
      "text": "（今天也是收获了满满一箩筐的段子素材喵！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_g:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2968414983c06d8b6bde057bab6411efc35666129c1d0bf61cd4f70d56ac3a",
      "text": "（等回到家里，可得好好整理段子喵。\n大忙特忙了喵！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:188c35d7729d74913c5e131fc78f59cc3fe1803a539dbc1f794d40a1f9c7a1e4",
      "text": "演出当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b7731e190da4500bd5cb152e5151a1306625502759a954b93d753d0757ed7d1",
      "text": "各位，非常感谢大家今天特地\n前来观看我们的演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2beb258cfe1a9532fbe0bb648743deca615a20d786d31b81dce057d803eae119",
      "text": "不知在场的各位中，有先参观了展览会\n之后再来到这里的观众吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac5bab8f36d703c16e50719872f71b3bced413890be3e6cf209c45c5f18b883f",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀？看样子似乎还有没去过的客人喵。\n蝴蝶先生，这该如何是好喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1678bab2214c2406764635955c0bd809504827c6cd46fcd99ceb58ff19118b1",
      "text": "那么，就由我们向那些正打算前去的孩子们\n好好宣传一番吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279f82bbcbcdb570c1926c445db6f7377da98073b844c1156a2577106403531f",
      "text": "这次我们身上穿的演出服，以及所使用的道具，\n全都融合了日本传统工艺的技艺哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:671985b192e11fe596f83c0eb6ea18cd3ffa69c7ed117c604c8de3d5f84a4136",
      "text": "亲自去会场找找对应的答案，感觉如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6294fb1df2ad5191088f0f1a7c803845b77b0a87ecb3ab3775ca3e225c00dce4",
      "text": "噢！真不愧是蝴蝶先生喵！\n看起来大家都变得兴致勃勃了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2253ebcf0798a30ca77a3bef06064e462cc429e92ec38c1eac4a0bcd37994fe",
      "text": "若是有兴趣的观众，请务必移步前往展览会\n看一看。演出结束后展馆也仍在开放。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34055281972568d8d6db45599e8a8ac3ebef8490a8de87bd4abf8b1c3adae41f",
      "text": "当然，改天再去也完全没问题喵～！\n语音导览会一直开放到展览会的最后一天喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88aef60a4f2b5c7398c238e720190cb6c42df2ba57be46e002b7bf471c794257",
      "text": "而且喵！除了语音导览之外，\n咱还筹划了一个超大的企划喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:517e4748076f35cb62e8cdab6eadd1d20419f376915fe7891f19cc06b95b96ef",
      "text": "这一次，为了能让大家产生兴趣，\n我们绞尽脑汁，做好了充分的准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b02b5fb71ec07e0b1393dae638b69478c024e43a62bfb4e9e502242ddeae0dd",
      "text": "详细的情报，预定将在本场演出结束后\n在官方主页上公布。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b867c05f1335dbc102ce8434cec91c4c5a776b1bd8b0ecf775f8d8d0446d661f",
      "text": "结束后请一定要去看一看哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:759460c471cdcb68ad0100daa244fb6a08e1654f24a0ba5486a63dc60287847f",
      "text": "那么，我们差不多该开始演出了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b2dffeaaa47856f2cf61b5045d811467171b5bf2c198fae28b5a86eb8dc8adf",
      "text": "好嘞喵～！各位贵宾，今天就请\n沉醉在在下们的华丽舞台之中吧喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c0d4f1fbf4fbcebda0ae26295c126933f913ca87a108b499cb8239739670b1f",
      "text": "您觉得如何？\n彩的舞台表现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0498a235031e95aa1e50b55949c09b89462a07368975faeeebbc83a4d29af95",
      "text": "啊啊。在悉心守护传统的同时，\n勇敢地去挑战崭新的事物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad547e141a2b335b12962e38160ecc1bebc0394693b3e8e9b0bdbfa5c50d34f",
      "text": "我也想像他们一样去发起挑战！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d99ddb434a429da4597039185769a9e1959552fe814ba05dd2cebca14a0ffbf",
      "text": "各位。再次祝贺这次的工作圆满收工，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:150f0ce9c3d273594f8466d0d49915284e1fb6f9f5be4a62012aabe4ea0bc007",
      "text": "制作人酱也辛苦啦。\n展览会和演出都顺顺利利办成功了，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e988a1c8f47810254726c27315b0c4bc917eb5cf0af0f5718506f5d641f993a",
      "text": "是的！而且听说追加的特别企划\n也获得了空前的热烈反响！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c6fc0791873f35da8fdddb0ff7c5d3f2d265e578f6c99cb2c5cc2dd1fa211be",
      "text": "就是那个展出我们在演出中所使用的\n服装和道具的企划吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf1e6f09a54148261c3ef46c41eae965548deec9a6037cfd1af9f7e77a2eeb19",
      "text": "是的！不仅是支持彩的各位粉丝，\n自不必说……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f4c67f511d2e78519d0cd236aa2bdd64f485dff1d463eb3a876cff36c67836",
      "text": "听说连就读于服装专门学校的学生们，\n也都怀着浓厚的兴趣赶来参观了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dcf65549e40aac2e4e10f2ef82bd259f0c9cf135161ada4d7f769239167a864",
      "text": "似乎是负责人在网站上公开的那部分服装特写照片，\n成为了引人注目的契机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:945f9ce71306b5cce834b0fdc34d9f180901f561bed187fb99acbc34d335995a",
      "text": "那可真是喵！意料之外的惊喜收获喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fb6480c0d997555dbdaf5822600a617525176c2688efc0a1d90784715f2d7d0",
      "text": "靠大家齐心协力，让展览会比预期中还要热闹得多，\n真是让人开心呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e91b1a712a29d698c6284b507e149797550f5db9edf4fb0c2f449f8e479f61e9",
      "text": "话说回来，制作人君。\n你想让我们看的是什么东西喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f3f15810315d024cd9cc347a76061c9875a4a08d07a00f221d9f5644369411a",
      "text": "应该和那边那个大箱子有关系吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1f3bdb533540c993e85325bc3ce7ac63147bdc0650f4e7369ad7446e7cf0d95",
      "text": "嗯，是的。前几天见面的匠人们，\n特意给各位寄来了包裹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00fe3fde863dd26e9dbb5b8e70ff541ebb0e2d0e9029dc7f5762d0250536100",
      "text": "这真是一套绝妙的茶具啊。\n连折扇和反物都有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21d0897e253b04ff246b7f92e0ba7707b21023c4ef7a3a3dfc32ea7344ba61aa",
      "text": "能切实感受到为了契合当今时代而做出的改良呢。\n这倒别有一番雅致，挺不错的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bbb048fb6a95e3f6b75f4da5edd275ea7577b07ec148fab5752b99c8b948052",
      "text": "是的。这是一套将传统与全新尝试融为一体的、\n崭新的工艺品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5275ce7c4d1b7bc6a1c0714c8e63c4370b63b3ab4c64f3d014191c754e6bb887",
      "text": "这把折扇的花纹也很有意思喵！\n……哎呀？里面还放着一封信喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80fed197eb70256c3612c14ff00e8fe691b9f7e2ead14e98e26a3c6a8b10a868",
      "text": "信上写着“下一次请务必不要以赞助形式，\n而是让我们正式提出工作委托”喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ee4a1d9bbc09d5c88449799e81d96fd75232f20792791305a3297e8fe5fbac9",
      "text": "真是令人感激的一封信啊。\n这份缘分，也一定要好好珍惜下去才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77d260088d303c85653913320e0ac2f258c19cb1f4bf4aef490a811c5397273b",
      "text": "嗯。为了今后还能再次一同合作，\n在下定当以偶像的身份勤勉精进。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9567846a78236caca5c66f616f79dfc1393c2b1ae84366ce7f5fec965f213cc1",
      "text": "在那一天到来之前，大家一起加把劲吧。\n争取能吸引来比现在还要多得多的人潮。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000106:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d0af65fa4da2f4b8c439b26fc05f338c4b5e540a95217eb0bbaf74b4c5125a",
      "text": "辛苦啦，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000108:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d63da56d48e11ea4c7b69d519627c99e9d0911a762c3935d70b99fccf104412",
      "text": "赠送给我们的工艺品，我已经立刻摆在家里装饰起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000110:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11004e2524c0c6ee018e58a75fd6ef4d79c390c47c95cd99314952e291a14c47",
      "text": "在守护传统的同时，勇敢地挑战全新事物的、\n这些工艺品……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000112:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7bbfa0ee33fa43a06df1d7d02d16b5f3bbae5bc12b0c0b48afa7e2403393834",
      "text": "简直就像我们彩一样呢。\n我会永远好好珍视它们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000114:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201ed0686a8e637938deac6dea51e14fa2e0efaafb2d1cc317b380c354ecc29d",
      "text": "确实是非常出色的\n工艺品呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000115:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3c17378e137560d9228e8ff293341b08b947e167da1905b7dff1f0efe63a5d2",
      "text": "匠人们想必也一定会\n很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69b3a024cb62695b44f75c8148713a604e51e47953245129040d1e7f0c7b787b",
      "text": "总觉得心里格外畅快呢。毕竟我们成为了\n促成这件作品诞生的契机。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5e13fa69aec3d0b29133e593f7520cc7560832ea3bc5bbe5e89484dd16ac4c6",
      "text": "……哎呀，感觉就像是在看着过去的自己一样，\n稍微有点让人发痒呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000122:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:313cf5c9a65873841822fcd1edbebcb16a7af62fd7a521b8da5de6b4795cef3a",
      "text": "收到了这么棒的赠礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_k:cmd-000124:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb8ea148fad7d52fc901f55e206b00da49c18cb1658d3745caf9fdf450ed52a2",
      "text": "我可不能输给这些匠人们，\n今后也会继续精进下去的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
